@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/bss-core/api

### GET without a cookie -> HTTP 401 SES001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### GET with an invalid cookie -> HTTP 401 SES001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me
Cookie: JSESSIONID=not-a-valid-session

### Mona: successful subscriber login
# Expected DATA: {"MSISDN":"01012345678","FULL_NAME":"Mona Adel","ROLE_CODE":"SUB"}
# Expected cookie: Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=...; path=/bss-core; HttpOnly
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### Mona profile and current balance
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"MSISDN":"01012345678","FULL_NAME":"Mona Adel","STATUS":"A","TARIFF_CODE":"PRE01","TARIFF_NAME":"Nile Prepaid","BALANCE_PIASTERS":6750,"ACTIVATION_DT":"01/03/2025"}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### SUB is denied operator subscriber lookup -> HTTP 200 SEC001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscribers/01012345678

### Re-login rotates the existing JSESSIONID
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### Missing PIN -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678

### Invalid MSISDN -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=123&pin=1234

### Invalid PIN format -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=12a4

### Unknown MSISDN -> AUTH001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01099999999&pin=1234

### Wrong PIN -> AUTH001 (same response as unknown MSISDN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=0000

### Suspended Salma with correct PIN -> AUTH002
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01234567890&pin=1111

### Suspended Salma with wrong PIN -> AUTH001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01234567890&pin=0000

### Karim: successful subscriber login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01123456789&pin=4321

### Youssef: successful subscriber login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01512345678&pin=2222

### Youssef profile: OLD99 tariff, zero balance, 12/08/2016 activation
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"MSISDN":"01512345678","FULL_NAME":"Youssef Fathy","STATUS":"A","TARIFF_CODE":"OLD99","TARIFF_NAME":"Classic 2015","BALANCE_PIASTERS":0,"ACTIVATION_DT":"12/08/2016"}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me
